OL,3,GNEWSAFertility patients have treatment
OL,4,A'paused' because of staff absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health board has apologised and
OL,7,Fsaid that "existing patients already
OL,8,Fundergoing active treatment are
OL,9,Funaffected".
